Z||000000||GarethWright||10-24-2001||02:51 AM||||I finally got some post-able pics this week, after spending 3 hours waxing it.<BR>so here's My 1987 Fiero GT:<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Front_320x240.jpg">   <BR>The square of lighter paint is from a "touch up" I did when I first got the car, the guy behind the counter said it was the same color    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Front-Drivers320x240.jpg">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Rear-Drivers_320x240.JPG">   <P><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Interior320x240.JPG">  <P><BR>so there ya go, not as spectacular as some, but I'm rather proud of it    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>-Gareth<P><BR>[Edited to add Interior Pic and Options]<BR>oh yea, options...<BR>2.8v6 (3.4 when I save enough pennies   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">), AC, Auto (blech), Factory High Performance Sound (replaced stock pushbutton tape deck with JVC CD player from last car, replaced factory sub speaker with a 6" Focal Utopia, still on factory amplifier, and in factory enclosure, bass level slider still works), Power Windows, Power Locks, and Power Mirrors (locks and mirrors added since I bought it), Rear Defrost, Remote Trunk Release, Delay Wipers, Tilt Steering, Sunroof, Herb Adams rear sway bar, and Fiero GT Floormats!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by GarethWright (edited 10-24-2001).]||||reg||1
