Z||000008||XDrewX||10-24-2001||01:55 PM||||Nice GT !!, ( I have a GT identical to yours  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">     <P>I also replaced my factory subwoofer, but I used Rodney Dickman's kit.<P>I love to listen to my music loud, needless to say, a 14 year old speaker driven by a new headunit did not survive long.  I belive it only ripped due to its age, not my new head unit.  Before it bit the dust, it sounded just as good as my 10" MTX driven by an Infinity 600 watt amp, that is in my Grand Prix.<P>Anyway, I was wondering how does your Focal sound ???<BR>also, what ohm is your new subwoofer.<P>I looked for a while, and could not find a small subwoofer that would fit in the factory enclosure that was not 8 ohm.<BR>The one I got from rodney is 8 ohm, and I cant hear the sub until I crank up the volume.<P>Any info appreciated.<BR> <P>||||reg||10
